  "body": "### What is the issue with the Console Standard?\n\nItem 3 of the definition of Formatter() at https://console.spec.whatwg.org/#formatter (\"Let _current_ be the second element of _args_.\") should be moved into the sublist of item 6 since it is only required there. This change reduces the scope of the definition of _current_ as well as improving its locality of reference.",
